## 8 · Observability (OBS)

- **OBS-1** `logs/agents.jsonl`: one row per model call — `ts, agent, model, chapter, iteration, input_tokens, output_tokens, cost_usd, duration_ms, engine, ctx_*_tokens, prev_hash, hash, config_hash`.
- **OBS-2** `logs/cost.json`: rollup per chapter and per agent; printed by the CLI at the end.
- **OBS-3** `novaforge status <slug>`: current stage, per-chapter status, iterations used, cost so far, budget remaining.
- **OBS-4** `novaforge diff <slug> <chapter>`: shows draft v1 → vN alongside the critiques that caused each rewrite (reads MEM-4 only). Cheap to build; makes the loop visible in a demo.

