## 11 · Acceptance for v0.1 (tiny)

`novaforge new "…" --config config/novel.config.json` must yield: 3 chapters `approved` in `state.json` with `config_hash`; `critiques/chNN.{continuity,science,length}.json` for every chapter; `bible/entities.json` consistent with `characters.md`; `summaries/running.md` ≤ 120 words; `dist/book.md` and `dist/book.pdf` and nothing else; `logs/cost.json` ≤ 2.0 USD; audit chain valid. Changing only `"profile": "small"` re-runs with 6 chapters and an empty `git diff -- '*.py'`.
